Found during k103. ClaudeSessions reports last_prompt = "" when the last user-typed line of a session holds only a tool_result (Claude Code writes tool results as type=user). t/native/claude-sessions-tail.t asserts this existing behaviour. Arguably the "most recent user prompt" should be the last user line with text. Product question for the maintainer; if yes, the head/tail scan keeps looking past text-less user lines.
